Texture packs in a PPSSPP layout: a chosen folder without its own textures.ini uses the
folder for this game up to two folders down (PSP/TEXTURES/<game id>): named after the game id,
else one whose textures.ini names the game in [games], else the only one with a textures.ini. (2026-11-15)

